; The instrument. Split five ways so that a mutator's reach and an oracle's
; soundness are separately assertable: an oracle that over-fires and a mutator
; that reaches nothing are invisible in each other's numbers.
;
; It links the plan, the interpreter and the layout, so it is a consumer of
; everything below it and nothing below it may depend on it.

